All rules files are created for you when you first run the game, so run the game once before trying to edit the files.

### Finding Rules Files

To view the files in a file manager, follow the steps for your Operating System below:

- **Windows**: Press Windows Key + R, type `%APPDATA%\nco\tiberian-dawn` and hit enter
- **macOS**: Open Finder, choose Go > Go to Folder and enter `~/Library/Application Support/nco/tiberian-dawn`
- **Linux**: In a terminal, run `xdg-open ~/.config/nco/tiberian-dawn`

Here are the full paths for reference (these are inside your user folder):

- **Windows**: `AppData\Roaming\nco\tiberian-dawn`
- **macOS**: `Library/Application Support/nco/tiberian-dawn`
- **Linux**: `.config/nco/tiberian-dawn`

> Note: You can also install custom scenario files in here (ini and bin files)

