## rules.ini

`rules.ini` is a simple text file that controls game engine behavior. This was included by default by Westwood in Red Alert onward. Below is a explanation of the sections in this file and different values that can be set.

> **NOTE**: Unlike Red Alert, the `rules.ini` for NCO Tiberian Dawn does not contain units, infantry etc. - see the top of this page for the individual files

