## Scenario INI

You can override any rule from `rules.ini` or from the type ini files (`infantry.ini`, `unit.ini` etc.) inside of the INI file for a given scenario. This is similar to the way Red Alert behaves, but not identical.

For example, given the following entry in `unit.ini`:

```ini
; Gun Boat
[BOAT]
Armor=STEEL
Cost=300
Explosion=FBALL1
IsAnimating=no
; other rules
```

You could add the below to the end of `scg01ea.ini` to give the Gunboat an Obelisk Laser:

```ini
; rest of scg01ea.ini

; Gun Boat
[BOAT]
Primary=OBELISK_LASER
```

